# SSH into HackStock BBS, log in as ch4zm/Time4phreaking!, press H to jump into
# PloverNet, register there, hunt for flag, then leave cleanly with G.
hit 5
wait 3
line ch4zm
wait 2
line Time4phreaking!
hit 10
# Ack any leftover prompts + skip both prompts (post-oneliner? read-mail?)
send N
wait 1
hit 3
send N
wait 1
hit 3
wait 3
# ---- At main menu ----
send H
wait 5
hit 6
# PloverNet NUP prompt
line MODSUX
wait 3
hit 4
# If it asks for a new username on PloverNet:
line ch4zm
wait 2
line Time4phreaking!
wait 2
line Time4phreaking!
wait 2
# Common SBBS new-user prompts: real name, location, etc — press enter through
hit 20
wait 3
# Explore: (M)essages, (F)iles, (T)ransfers, then (G)oodbye to logoff cleanly
send M
wait 3
hit 6
# List all subs
send L
wait 3
hit 6
send Q
wait 2
# Files
send F
wait 3
hit 6
send Q
wait 2
# Now leave cleanly
send G
wait 3
send Y
wait 3
